# ---- IWA signing keys -------------------------------------------------------
# Per-tool Ed25519 private key that signs the Web Bundle. If leaked, someone
# else can publish updates as YOU. Regenerated locally via `npm run keygen`.
signing.key
**/signing.key

# ---- Generated bundle output (defense in depth alongside dist/) -------------
*.swbn
**/public/icons/

